Network: LAN host grants.

A name in `network_hosts` reaches only public addresses (12). A
`network_lan_hosts` name may also resolve to private networks: the private
IPv4 ranges, shared address space and IPv6 unique local addresses, for a
server the user names, like `homeassistant.local`. Loopback and link-local,
and with it the metadata endpoint, stay closed. Covers net.connect,
WebSocket and fetch.

